title: [+ chancellor +] 的经济计划
subtitle: 执政内阁采取了坚定的亲商立场
view-if: year >= 1935 and papen_chancellor_timer <= 0 and (not spd_in_government or spd_toleration) and chancellor_party != "SPD" and chancellor_party != "KPD" and chancellor != "Wirth" and laissez_faire_timer <= 0
on-arrival: welfare_cut = 0; tax_cut = 0; tariff_hike = 0; welfare_cut = 1 if welfare >= 2; welfare -= 2 if welfare_cut; budget += 2 if welfare_cut; budget += welfare if not welfare_cut and welfare >= 0; welfare = 0 if not welfare_cut; tax_cut = 1 if budget >= 2 and upper_tax_rates >= 1; budget -= 2 if tax_cut; upper_tax_rates -= 1 if tax_cut; inflation -= 0.5; economic_growth += 0.5; economic_growth += 0.4 if economic_growth < 2; economic_growth += 0.3 if eu; tariff_hike = 1 if budget <= 0; tariffs += 1 if tariff_hike; inflation += 1 if inflation > 0 and tariff_hike; inflation += 0.5 if inflation <= 0 and tariff_hike; unemployed += 1 if tariff_hike; budget += 2 if tariff_hike; west_relation -= 1 if tariff_hike; east_relation -= 1 if tariff_hike; reparations_negotiation -= 2 if tariff_hike; eu_progress -= 1 if eu_progress > 0 and tariff_hike; economic_growth -= 0.4 if tariff_hike;  {! 
Q.laissez_faire_timer = Math.floor(Math.random() * (14 - 8 + 1)) + 8;
!}
new-page: true
#tags: event
go-to: menu
# todo: max visits 3, 12 month cooldown

= [+ chancellor +] 的经济计划

随着危机在世界范围内开始消退,[+ chancellor +] 内阁为刺激外国投资以修复经济,已开始回撤对工人的保护、在劳资纠纷中强力支持雇主、削减福利并减税。经济增长略有起色,但工人阶级丝毫感受不到这场复苏的果实。

@menu 
on-arrival: old_middle_dvp += 5; workers_kpd += 3; unemployed_kpd += 5; new_middle_dvp += 2; old_middle_other += 4

- @bring_down: 搞垮这个政府!
- @no_choice: 我们别无选择,只能继续容忍。
- @support_strikes: 支持德国工会总联合会罢工,反抗这个政府。
- @rally_: 集会反对政府!

@bring_down
view-if: spd_toleration
on-arrival: time_to_election = 3; spd_toleration = 0; spd_in_government = 0
call: set_next_election_time

我们在国会提出不信任案,搞垮了 [+ chancellor +] 政府。 新的选举已定于 [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +]。

@no_choice
view-if: spd_toleration
on-arrival: workers_spd -= 5; unemployed_spd -= 5; dvp_relation += 2; labor_dissent += 5; left_dissent += 5; reformist_strength += 5

为了保住民主,我们别无选择,只能容忍这些举动。

@support_strikes
view-if: not unions_independent and not spd_toleration
subtitle: -1 资源
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: -1 资源 —— 我们负担不起。
on-arrival: resources -= 1; workers_spd += 4*(1-dissent); labor_dissent -= 5; labor_strength += 5; unemployed_spd += 4*(1-dissent); workers_z -= 2; 

我们向正在进行的反政府罢工提供财政支持,加剧了他们挑起的阶级冲突,也加强了我们与政府的关系。

@rally_
view-if: not spd_toleration
go-to: rally.main_rally